        "jsCode": "const thumbnailUrl = $json.data[0].url;\nconst scriptData = $('Parser - Script TikTok').first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    thumbnail_url: thumbnailUrl,\n    hook: scriptData.hook,\n    script: scriptData.full_script,\n    hashtags: scriptData.hashtags,\n    message: `✅ Script TikTok prêt !\\n\\n📌 HOOK: ${scriptData.hook}\\n\\n📝 SCRIPT COMPLET: ${scriptData.script}\\n\\n🖼️ Miniature générée: ${thumbnailUrl}\\n\\nCopiez le script et filmez votre vidéo !`\n  }\n}];"
